        "created_at": "2011-12-18T03:57:21.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Me and another experienced player showed two other people how to play today. Against Voss in Atlantis things went easily enough that I decided to show them what a hard game can look like. Our second game, therefore, was Dawn on advanced mode on Mars. It turned into a cakewalk! I couldn’t believe it. Won with everyone in double digits. Ra, Tempest, Visionary, and Bunker.</p>",
